Documentation     [SUITE PURPOSE]   Configuration related keywords for feature CB010513-I ...
...               Prerequisite : commissioning is managed by custom-config and basic_setup.cfg must be properly configured
...               Scope : keywords for CB010513-I
...
...               Test Case Scenario author   : vincent.boulet@nokia.com
...               Creation Date               : 2023-07-07
...               Modified Date               : 2023-07-07

...               Last Modified by            : vincent.boulet@nokia.com
...               Version    Date      Author                                Notes
...               0.1        FB2314    vincent.boulet@nokia.com              Creation robot
...                                                                          Introduce new parameter on ue settings for throughput ul
...               1.0        FB2314    vincent.boulet@nokia.com              Collect PM files from BTS
...                                                                          Use CB010513-C_KPI_Definitions.csv for private KPI
...               1.1        FB2419    richard.duthu@nokia.com               Scout data + some fixes for RF50
